","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「如果自己能像阿嬤那樣將它們熬煮成果醬，豈不是『兩全其美』嗎？」這裡的『兩全其美』指的是哪兩件事呢？","n":50,"ssz":".....................1............................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"能解決次級水果被丟棄的問題，也可以用做果醬來懷念阿嬤","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"能解決找工作不易的困境，製作果醬還能夠精進自己的廚藝","n":26,"ssz":"......1..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"能解決找工作不易的困境，也能解決次級水果被丟棄的問題","n":26,"ssz":"......1..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"能解決找工作不易的困境，還能出國參加果醬比賽為國爭光","n":26,"ssz":"......1...............1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"林韡勳在「研發與銷售」自己的果醬時遇到了許多困難，下列哪一項不是這個階段的問題？","n":40,"ssz":"............................1.1..1......"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"要如何籌措前往出國參加果醬比賽的旅費","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"沒有製作果醬的專業背景，導致製作頻頻失敗","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"追求果醬品質導致果醬售價太高，賣不出去","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"研發果醬的過程失敗太多次，浪費了許多食材","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下面哪個事件直接促使林韡勳開始參加英國果醬比賽？","n":24,"ssz":"...1...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"林韡勳不想浪費食物，所以把做失敗的果醬拿去餵蜜蜂","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"林韡勳沒有果醬專業背景，仍堅持不斷研究並製作果醬","n":24,"ssz":"...............1........"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx