..............1........1................................................................................1.......1..........1.........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這課描述林韡勳創業成功的故事。想把一個故事講清楚，最常見的敘事結構就是「問題","n":38,"ssz":"..................1..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"解決","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"結果」：主角遇見什麼問題？主角怎麼解決？結果如何？","n":25,"ssz":".....1........1.........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"但真實世界的故事，總是有許多複雜的內容，會讓讀者不容易看出「問題","n":32,"ssz":"................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"結果」的文章結構，例如，下圖就把本課的「問題」再細分出「認清問題」和「拆解問題」兩個步驟，我們就來學習這個「問題解決流程」吧！","n":63,"ssz":".................................1.......1..........1.........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、從課文裡學「問題\n解決\n結果」","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、從課文裡學「問題","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"結果」","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我們先用（第六段）林韡勳的一個例子來說明他的問題解決步驟吧！","n":30,"ssz":"..............1.1............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.確認問題：","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請確認主角最主要想解決的問題（單選）。","n":19,"ssz":"....1.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"如何利用那些小小、醜醜、酸酸的水果？","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"如何製作出優質果醬、並受到市場歡迎？","n":18,"ssz":"