遇險死亡。❽事發9天後才發現受困的足球隊，而且都還活著。❾救援團隊準備氧氣瓶，在危險路段安排潛水員接應，讓孩子們在協助下，一段一段通過積水區。","n":117,"ssz":"...................................1........1.......................................................1......1........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[18].paragraphs[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❿救援啟動18天後，13名受難者終於全數安全離開洞穴。","n":27,"ssz":"..............1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[20].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請確認這則報導中最主要想解決的問題（單選）。","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[20].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"13名受難者究竟困在洞穴何處？","n":15,"ssz":"....1.........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[20].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"如何弄清楚洞穴裡的地形與路徑？","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[20].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"如何救出困在洞穴裡的13人？","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[20].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"如何快速召募到潛水員、募集到需用的物資（如氧氣瓶）","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[21].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"２.拆解問題：","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[22].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請判斷報導中最主要想解決的問題，可以拆解成哪些小問題？（多選）","n":31,"ssz":"..............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[22].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"如何快速召募潛水員、募集到必要物資（如氧氣瓶）？","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[22].options.5","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"如何幫助不會游泳的少年穿過被水封住的路段？","n":21,"ssz":"....1....1..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[23].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"３.問題解決過程：","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[24].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"底下表格呈現了泰國洞穴救援的故事，請你在四個步驟（確認問題、拆解問題、逐項解決 或 確認結果）中擇一填入，並在右欄填入句子的代號❶、❷……。","n":70,"ssz":".....................1...........................2..........1........."},{"s